.* root directory of this project.
.*
.* QUILICKEY: DSPLICKEY, one license key to a display; Enter shows the
.* next. The empty :DATACOL. puts the colon at column 30 as the 7.1
.* golden has it; the empty :DATAC. rows are its blank lines.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SHORTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 44'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=PRDID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=LICTRM CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=FEATURE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRDTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=SERIAL CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRCGRP CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=LICKEY CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=LICKEY2 CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=LICKEY3 CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=USGLMT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=EXPDATE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=VNDDTA CLASS=TEXTCL.
:KEYL NAME=DSPKEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPLICKEY HELP=HLPKEY KEYL=DSPKEYS ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=DATETIME.Display License Key Information
:DATA DEPTH='*' SCROLL=IND.
:DATACOL WIDTH=29.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRDID' VAR=PRDID USAGE=OUTPUT.Product identifier
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LICTRM' VAR=LICTRM USAGE=OUTPUT.License term
:DATAI HELP='FLD/FEATURE' VAR=FEATURE USAGE=OUTPUT.Feature
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRDTEXT' VAR=PRDTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/SERIAL' VAR=SERIAL USAGE=OUTPUT.System serial number
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/PRCGRP' VAR=PRCGRP USAGE=OUTPUT.Processor group
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LICKEY' VAR=LICKEY USAGE=OUTPUT.License Key
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LICKEY2' VAR=LICKEY2 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/LICKEY3' VAR=LICKEY3 USAGE=OUTPUT.
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/USGLMT' VAR=USGLMT USAGE=OUTPUT.Usage limit
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/EXPDATE' VAR=EXPDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Expiration date
:DATAC.
:DATAI HELP='FLD/VNDDTA' VAR=VNDDTA USAGE=OUTPUT.Vendor data
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPKEY.Display License Key Information - Help
:P.A license key added with ADDLICKEY: the product, term and feature it
unlocks, the system and processor group it is for, how many users it
allows and until when. Enter shows the next key that matched.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRDID'.Product identifier
:P.A product identifier&colon. seven characters, 5770SS1 for example.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICTRM'.License term
:P.The license term of the product, for example V7 or V7R1.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/FEATURE'.Feature
:P.The feature code of the product.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRDTEXT'.Description
:P.The description shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/SERIAL'.System serial number
:P.The system serial number shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/PRCGRP'.Processor group
:P.The processor group shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICKEY'.License Key
:P.The license Key shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICKEY2'.LICKEY2
:P.The LICKEY2 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/LICKEY3'.LICKEY3
:P.The LICKEY3 shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/USGLMT'.Usage limit
:P.The usage limit shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/EXPDATE'.Expiration date
:P.The date after which the object or file can be deleted or
overwritten. *PERM means it never expires.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/VNDDTA'.Vendor data
:P.The vendor data shown for what the display is about.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
